{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50774","headline":"题灵岩寺 · 张祜","name":"题灵岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北寺三年别，西湖十里程。\n山门桥上转，石路阁中行。\n地入千重险，江分一面平。\n引藤闻鼠乱，窥洞见龙惊。\n嶂月排檐出，屏风倚槛成。\n猿寻青壁过，树遶碧崖生。\n小殿灵云影，高廊下水声。\n何当还梦谢，尽我一诗情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}